== a11_globalassign
  san:    exit 0 local 0 inner0|local 1 inner1|
  O3:     exit 0 local 0 inner0|local 1 inner1|
  interp: exit 0 local 0 inner0|local 1 inner1|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/a11_globalassign.debug.san
--- run san
local 0 inner0
local 1 inner1
--- run O3
local 0 inner0
local 1 inner1
--- interpret
local 0 inner0
local 1 inner1
